  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Regular-mode experience overrides REMOVED (1.1.0.0 unification):
  // Anesthesia, Energy Crisis, No Place for Renegades, and The Huntsman Path
  // - Sadist previously corrected regular here because tarkov.dev mirrored
  // the PvE value into regular and the wiki (PvP witness) documented a
  // different figure. The Season 1 patch notes state the task-reward
  // rebalance applies to ALL game modes, and the 1.1-pve data carries single
  // mode-free values - so the 1.1 figures tarkov.dev serves for regular are
  // now correct and the regular overrides were actively wrong. Their registry
  // entries in src/divergences/tasks.json5 are converged; the wiki pages
  // still show the pre-1.0 values and are treated as stale. Recover the
  // overrides from git history if a PvP capture disproves the unification.
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
